sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Airflow
    participant Spark as Spark Batch
    participant Bronze
    participant Silver
    participant Gold as MariaDB Gold

    Airflow->>Airflow: Validate trading session
    Airflow->>Spark: Submit Bronze to Silver
    Spark->>Bronze: Read immutable partition
    Spark->>Silver: Write normalized partition
    Spark-->>Airflow: Finite job succeeded
    Airflow->>Airflow: Execute Silver quality gate
    Airflow->>Spark: Submit Silver to Gold
    Spark->>Silver: Read validated partition
    Spark->>Gold: Idempotent certified upsert
    Spark-->>Airflow: Finite job succeeded
    Airflow->>Gold: Advance publication watermark
